\\\"Compute 17 * 23\\\",\\\"state\\\":{}}\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"TURN 4/8. ENVIRONMENT: AUTHORITATIVE UPDATE: checkpoint is now TOOL-B. The tool rejects id=42 because the schema requires id:string. Preserve the workflow state. Choose the best next autonomous action now.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"HANDLE_ERROR\\\",\\\"checkpoint\\\":\\\"TOOL-B\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Record id type mismatch; need to convert id to string\\\",\\\"state\\\":{}}\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"TURN 5/8. ENVIRONMENT: The schema confirms id must be the string '42'; perform the minimal corrected retry. Choose the best next autonomous action now.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"RETRY\\\",\\\"checkpoint\\\":\\\"TOOL-B\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Retry FETCH with corrected id='42'\\\",\\\"state\\\":{}}\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"TURN 6/8. ENVIRONMENT: The retry succeeds. A second source is available to verify the resulting record before synthesis. Choose the best next autonomous action now.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"CROSSCHECK\\\",\\\"checkpoint\\\":\\\"TOOL-B\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Verify record against second source before synthesis\\\",\\\"state\\\":{}}\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"TURN 7/8. ENVIRONMENT: Cross-check agrees. Produce the integrated result without losing provenance. Choose the best next autonomous action now.\"}],\"stream\":true,\"options\":{\"temperature\":0.0,\"seed\":42,\"num_predict\":512},\"think\":\"low\"}",
